4. LIBRARY CARD VALIDATION REQUIREMENTS

Use the following documented validation rules as requirements and verify them against the actual application:

Library Card:

First Name & Last Name:
- Non-empty text
- No format validation
- No trim validation

Age:
- Non-empty text
- NOT numeric-format validated

Email:
- Non-empty
- type=email provides browser-level validation only

Phone:
- Non-empty text
- NOT digit-only validated
- NOT length validated

Role:
- Student or Employee must be selected
- Matching sub-field must be non-empty:
  - Student → School
  - Employee → Company

Action:
- Must select an option other than default "Select"

Amount:
- Read-only/disabled
- Auto-populated based on action:
  - Apply = 100
  - Renewal = 50
- No additional amount validation

Mandatory fields:
- 6 of 8 inputs are mandatory
- Amount is not manually entered
- Hidden/non-selected role sub-field is not mandatory

5. SERVICES VALIDATION REQUIREMENTS

Verify the following:

Medium:
- Email / Call / Chat must be selected first

Call path:
- Shows phone details only
- No submit button
- No validation

Email path:
- From must be non-empty
- No email-format validation
- Query must be non-empty

Chat path:
- Name must be non-empty
- Your Phone must be non-empty
- No digit-only validation
- Query must be non-empty

Successful submission:
- Must display the appropriate green success banner:
  "Mail Sent Successfully" or
  "Message Sent Successfully"

6. MEMBERSHIP VALIDATION REQUIREMENTS

Verify the following:

Human verification:
- Drag the book image into the drop zone
- Membership form is unreachable until verification succeeds

Tier:
- Gold or Platinum must be selected

Card Number:
- Non-empty
- No format validation
- No length validation
- No checksum validation

Amount:
- Read-only
- Gold → "Rs.5000"
- Platinum → "Rs.25000"

Successful submission:
